# My MaNaGeR .gitignore
# Repo files (source + runtime assets)
node_modules/
dist/
# Local wrangler/miniflare dev state (D1/R2/KV/DO sqlite + cache). Regenerated
# on demand; never source, and it churns on every local run.
.wrangler/
wrangler-state/
mmgr-ak-ci-wstate/
mmgr-backnav-profile/
mmgr-chrome-probe/
mmgr-cdskel-*
mmgr-ci-state/
mmgr-gltriage-*
mmgr-perfdflt-*
mmgr-prodperf-*
mmgr-probe-profile/
mmgr-wrangler-state/
mmgr-ak-live-wstate/
mmgr-e2e-state/
mmgr-touch-profile-*
wrangler-calcws-state/
wrangler-e2e-state/
wrangler-extended-state/
wrangler-state/
wrangler-state2/
rowproof-wstate/
# Local research toolkit (Playwright binaries are huge)
web-research/
# Project-local scratch convention (see AGENTS.md lesson 9): cross-tool
# session scratch (probe outputs, fetched pages, temp scripts) goes here,
# NOT in /tmp - Git Bash's /tmp maps to the Windows temp dir, so a file
# written by bash is invisible to Windows Python/node paths (real
# FileNotFoundError incidents 2026-09-11). Never committed, never staged
(tar --exclude='tmp' in the deploy recipe + tmp in .assetsignore).
/tmp/
# Session scratch / reference material kept on disk but NEVER deployed or
# committed (the staging deploy recipe in wrangler.jsonc must exclude
# these too - wrangler static assets does NOT honor .gitignore):
/Freebuff add a full comprehensive calculater as a project ….txt
/Windows PowerShell bhk.txt
/Windows PowerShell last session.txt
/Windows PowerShell pt 2.txt
/Windows PowerShell you keep crashing when kill the nodes.txt
/Windows PowerShell.txt
/crashes from last session.txt
/LIVE-SITE-UI-AUDIT-2026-08-22.md
/SECURITY-FIXES-IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md
/my_manager_web favicon image to use.png
/Freebuff Also, Wrangler requires an update as I've seen  last session.txt
/Freebuff OK this starts I  from last session.txt
/Freebuff continue last session.txt
